                        "review": "It makes sense that this started as a flash game because that's about the amount of content to expect from this. It's fun, but there's not much to do after a few hours (unless you have friends to play with...) \r\nAlso, just to nitpick, some of the art style choices (especially the level backgrounds) doesn't feel super cohesive, but from what I've seen Blaze expands on all of that, so I look forward to playing some day.",
